 angesaroundme.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T230605Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20251118T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20251118T190000
SUMMARY:TxDOT: US 281 Blanco Relief Route Study (Blanco)
LOCATION:Blanco High School Cafeteria & Gym 1215 4th St. Blanco\, TX 78606
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/hearings-meetings/austin/2025/us281-blan
 co-relief-route-study-111825.html
DESCRIPTION:In-person meeting\; materials also posted online\nPublic commen
 t deadline: 9 Dec 2025.\n\n—\n\nPurpose: The purpose of this study\, in 
 collaboration with local stakeholders and the public\, is to develop a rel
 ief route alignment around the city of Blanco that meets TxDOT’s mission
  and reflects community values.\n\nDescription: With support from the city
  of Blanco and Blanco County\, TxDOT has initiated the US 281 Blanco Relie
 f Route Study to develop and evaluate preliminary relief route options to 
 enhance safety and improve mobility along US 281 in the city of Blanco.\n\
 n—\n\nProject info: https://www.txdot.gov/projects/projects-studies/aust
 in/us281-blanco-relief-route.html
CATEGORIES:engagement
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:txdotev-hm-us281-blanco-county-project-111825-20251118@calendars.change
 saroundme.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T230605Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20251118T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20251118T190000
SUMMARY:TxDOT: US 281 Blanco County Project (Blanco)
LOCATION:Blanco High School Cafeteria & Gym 1215 4th St. Blanco\, TX 78606
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/hearings-meetings/austin/2025/us281-blan
 co-county-project-111825.html
DESCRIPTION:In-person meeting\; materials also posted online\nPublic commen
 t deadline: 9 Dec 2025.\n\n—\n\nPurpose: TxDOT is developing preliminary
  plans to improve 19 miles of US 281 from US 290 to FM 306 in Blanco Count
 y\, Texas\, including the US 281/US 290 interchange.\n\nDescription: The p
 urpose of the proposed project is to enhance safety and improve connectivi
 ty and mobility by providing additional roadway capacity to meet current a
 nd future traffic demands due to population growth and increased traffic v
 olumes.
CATEGORIES:engagement
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
