 )
LOCATION:Virtual
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/hearings-meetings/public-transportation/
 2026/actionetwork.html
DESCRIPTION:Virtual meeting - online materials only\; no fixed time (no in-
 person meeting)\nPublic comment deadline: 10 Jul 2026.\n\n—\n\nPurpose: 
 Public outreach through a virtual survey for the ACTIONetwork will build u
 pon outreach conducted for the Statewide Active Transportation Plan (SATP)
  and District Bike Plans (DBP). The primary purpose of ACTIONetwork is pri
 oritization of TxDOT on-system roadway corridors for bike and pedestrian i
 nfrastructure investment. This public outreach activity will help to refin
 e criteria used in establishing prioritization and identify corridors for 
 active transportation implementation. Any additional feedback provided wil
 l be considered as we identify priority corridors for active transportatio
 n investments.\n\nDescription: The first implementation priority action id
 entified by the Statewide Active Transportation Plan (SATP) was to identif
 y and invest in Statewide Active Transportation Networks and specifically 
 to “Begin identification of a priority investment network to direct inve
 stment in critical corridors”. TxDOT has begun this initial task with th
 e development of the Active Transportation Investment Opportunity Network 
 (ACTION).\n\n—\n\nProject info: https://www.txdot.gov/projects/projects-
 studies/statewide/statewide-active-transportation-plan.html
CATEGORIES:engagement
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
