BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:txdotev-hm-i35-georgetown-to-round-rock-081326-20260813@calendars.chang
 esaroundme.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T230605Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260813T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260813T183000
SUMMARY:TxDOT: I-35 Georgetown to Round Rock
LOCATION:Williamson County Georgetown Annex 100 Wilco Way Georgetown\, TX 7
 8626
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/hearings-meetings/austin/2026/i35-george
 town-to-round-rock-081326.html
DESCRIPTION:In-person meeting\; materials also posted online\nPublic commen
 t deadline: 28 Aug 2026.\n\n—\n\nPurpose: TxDOT is proposing improvement
 s along 13 miles of I-35 from SH 29 to SH 45 North in Williamson County\, 
 Texas.\n\nDescription: The I-35 Georgetown to Round Rock Project proposes 
 to:\n- Add two non-tolled high-occupancy vehicle managed lanes in each dir
 ection\n- Add one mainlane in each direction between SH 29 and RM 1431\n- 
 Relocate and modify entrance and exit ramps\n- Reconstruct several bridges
  and cross street intersections\n- Add bypass lanes where needed\n- Add sh
 ared-use paths throughout the corridor\nAny environmental documentation\, 
 studies\, maps or drawings showing the project location and design\, tenta
 tive construction schedules and other information regarding the proposed p
 roject are on file and available for inspection Monday through Friday betw
 een the hours of 8 a.m. and 5 p.m. at 7901 N. I-35\, Austin\, TX 78753 or 
 by calling 512-939-3953. These materials will also be available in hard co
 py form for review at the in-person meeting and online on this webpage.\n\
 n—\n\nProject info: https://www.txdot.gov/mobility35/projects/i35-george
 town-to-round-rock.html
CATEGORIES:engagement
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:txdotev-hm-us79-from-i35-to-fm1460-090126-20260901@calendars.changesaro
 undme.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T230605Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
SUMMARY:TxDOT: US 79 from I-35 to east of FM 1460
LOCATION:Virtual
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/hearings-meetings/austin/2026/us79-from-
 i35-to-fm1460-090126.html
DESCRIPTION:Virtual meeting - pre-recorded video presentation only\; no fix
 ed time\, materials post by 5:30pm (no in-person meeting)\nPublic comment 
 deadline: 16 Sep 2026.\n\n—\n\nPurpose: TxDOT and the city of Round Rock
  are proposing improvements to US 79 from I-35 to east of A.W. Grimes Boul
 evard in Williamson County\, Texas. This notice advises the public that Tx
 DOT will be hosting a virtual public meeting.\n\nDescription: The proposed
  improvements include widening the existing US 79 highway to add a third t
 ravel lane in each direction with a raised median and selected median brea
 ks\, constructing intersection improvements featuring grade separations at
  Mays Street and at A.W. Grimes Boulevard\, reconfiguring the US 79 and I-
 35 intersection\, modifying driveways and access points to improve safety 
 and traffic flow\, and installing shared-use paths on both sides of US 79 
 to enhance pedestrian and bicycle accommodations.\n\n—\n\nProject info: 
 https://www.txdot.gov/projects/projects-studies/austin/us79-i35-east-fm146
 0.html
CATEGORIES:engagement
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
END:VEVENT
